---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Hero from '../../components/Hero.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Air Freight"
  description="International air freight for urgent, valuable, and fragile cargo with worldwide departures."
  image="/images/air.jpg"
>
  <Hero
    compact
    brand="AIR"
    headline="When every hour counts, fly the freight."
    support="Daily and weekly departures to air destinations worldwide for time-sensitive consignments."
    image="/images/air.jpg"
    secondaryCta={{ label: 'Get a Quote', href: '/quote' }}
  />

  <section class="section">
    <div class="container content reveal">
      <p>
        International air freight is the fastest way to ship goods overseas — typically for urgent and
        time-sensitive consignments. Our air freight logistics planning and execution promise timely
        delivery, with daily and weekly departures to destinations across the globe.
      </p>
      <p>
        Nexar Solutions arranges comprehensive services for urgent, valuable, fragile, or any cargo
        that needs accelerated air delivery. When the clock is against you, you can count on our strong
        relationships with leading airlines and shipping lines.
      </p>
      <p>
        We can transport consignments to any part of the world safely. Pickup facilities are available
        worldwide, and we also provide export packing services for your convenience.
      </p>

      <h2>What we arrange</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Door-to-door service for cleared or uncleared goods</li>
        <li>Direct services with IATA airlines</li>
        <li>Consular documentation and certificates of origin</li>
        <li>Commercial services and marine insurance support</li>
        <li>Presentation of letters of credit</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>Why shippers choose air</h2>
      <p>
        <strong>Speed.</strong> Air is the fastest method for perishable, fragile, or high-value
        merchandise. While sea freight often takes three to six weeks, air shipments typically arrive
        in three days to one week.
      </p>
      <p>
        <strong>Accessibility.</strong> We can send goods almost anywhere in Africa, Asia, and Europe —
        including destinations where air is the only practical option.
      </p>

      <a class="btn btn-primary" href="/quote">Request an air freight quote</a>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .content {
    max-width: 72ch;
  }

  h2 {
    margin-top: 2rem;
    font-size: 1.55rem;
  }

  ul {
    padding-left: 1.2rem;
    color: var(--muted);
  }

  .btn {
    margin-top: 1.5rem;
  }
</style>
